<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Filter said attractive.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Filter said attractive.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber initiated coverage of U.S. Filter Corp with an attractive rating, according to a PaineWebber source.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/8 to 31-7/8 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
